            "sid": "EST 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio kwini Esta, omukhaana owa Abihaili, alala ne Omuyaudi Modekai baandika ebarwa eye khabili khutinyilisia kamakhuwa khuloondekhana ne Purimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chibarwa charumwa khu Bayaudi boosi, bali mungoongo emia ndala ne kamakhumi kabili na saba che mu bwami bwa Ahuswero. Ebarwa eyo yabamo kamakhuwa ke kumuleembe ne buliindi bulayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bababoolela bali chindaalo cha Purimu chino chikhoya chakhebulilwa mu biise bibiaroborwa nga Modekai ne kwini Esta babekesia. Bekesia Bayaudi nende be lisaaye liabwe khuloondekhana ne khukhweyimana khulia siise sie khusooma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lilaka lia Esta lie khutinyilisia kumwiima kwa Purimu liaandikwa mu sitabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.32"
            ]
          }
